1258
01:12:20,010 --> 01:12:24,810
Omaru Polka's debut song...

1259
01:12:24,810 --> 01:12:26,810
...excluding Hologram Circus and Po...

1260
01:12:26,810 --> 01:12:28,810
...grandpa's song...

1261
01:12:28,810 --> 01:12:30,610
Oh, a little to the side.

1262
01:12:30,610 --> 01:12:32,410
Oh, that didn't work.

1263
01:12:32,410 --> 01:12:33,390
Say it all!

1264
01:12:33,390 --> 01:12:38,000
The timing to press it is funny.

1265
01:12:38,000 --> 01:12:39,810
And the footing...

1266
01:12:39,810 --> 01:12:42,610
This is fun!

1267
01:12:42,610 --> 01:12:43,610
Press this one too.

1268
01:12:43,610 --> 01:12:44,610
Magic House!

1269
01:12:44,610 --> 01:12:49,310
And, fire the ball!

1270
01:12:49,310 --> 01:12:50,310
Yes!

1271
01:12:50,310 --> 01:12:52,110
Yes!

1272
01:12:52,110 --> 01:12:52,980
Here we go!

1273
01:12:52,980 --> 01:12:53,910
Come back, please!

1274
01:12:53,910 --> 01:12:54,710
Yes!

1275
01:12:54,710 --> 01:12:57,510
Alright, nice!

1276
01:12:57,510 --> 01:12:59,510
Phew, thank you!

1277
01:12:59,510 --> 01:13:00,510
As expected!

1278
01:13:00,510 --> 01:13:02,310
That was rough, huh.

1279
01:13:02,310 --> 01:13:06,310
Oh, can't we do it with this? This!

1280
01:13:06,310 --> 01:13:09,310
We did it!

1281
01:13:09,310 --> 01:13:11,310
Quick, quick!

1282
01:13:11,310 --> 01:13:13,310
Luna-chan, you did great!

1283
01:13:13,310 --> 01:13:19,110
This is less of a puzzle and more just... rage-inducing, right?

1284
01:13:19,110 --> 01:13:21,910
Hurry, hurry!

1285
01:13:21,910 --> 01:13:24,910
Yeah! That was 07!

1286
01:13:24,910 --> 01:13:26,710
