1290
01:13:35,710 --> 01:13:38,710
There's an elevator coming up, and there are turrets too!

1291
01:13:38,710 --> 01:13:40,710
Turrets again?

1292
01:13:40,710 --> 01:13:42,510
Oh, there are turrets.

1293
01:14:11,720 --> 01:14:13,520
