1306
01:14:36,320 --> 01:14:38,120
Like a cutscene thing.

1307
01:14:38,120 --> 01:14:39,090
No idea.

1308
01:14:39,090 --> 01:14:39,920
Oh, this...

1309
01:14:39,920 --> 01:14:40,920
What kind of...

