01:14:40,920 --> 01:14:41,920
What kind of intention is that?!

1311
01:14:41,920 --> 01:14:42,720
Heave-ho!

1312
01:14:42,720 --> 01:14:43,720
Oh, I made it!

1313
01:14:43,720 --> 01:14:45,520
We can get through!

1314
01:14:45,520 --> 01:14:47,320
We can get through, but...

1315
01:14:47,320 --> 01:14:48,320
What even is this?

1316
01:14:48,320 --> 01:14:50,120
We can get through, but then what?

1317
01:14:50,120 --> 01:14:51,120
Get through!

1318
01:14:51,120 --> 01:14:54,920
Hmm, the ink...

1319
01:14:54,920 --> 01:14:55,920
From over there...

1320
01:14:55,920 --> 01:14:57,720
Like, connect them?

1321
01:14:57,720 --> 01:14:59,720
We can connect them somehow, but...

1322
01:14:59,720 --> 01:15:02,720
Polka can't shoot from this side though.

